        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88GB Solid Brass Grab Bars</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese ADA compliant solid brass grab bars are available in 5 lengths from 18 inches to 42 inches in polished chrome, satin nickel, or oil rubbed bronze finishes. They have a 1-1/2 Inch diameter. TThese are most often used in the bathrooms near the tub and toilet but they are perfect for anywhere ADA compliant grab bars are required.  Both the 36 inch lengths and the 42 inch lengths have a center post to secure the middle of the grab bar.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Deltana 88 Series Contemporary Grab Bars:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Tube Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
